  "description": "COWTIU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C152 H168 Gd4 N12 O16,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.606-3.931 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.32-111.97°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C156H174Gd4N14O16.",
